### HTTP Client Setup
```csharp
services.AddHttpClient<IPedidosYaClient, PedidosYaClient>()
    .ConfigureHttpClient((sp, client) =>
    {
        var config = sp.GetRequiredService<IOptions<PedidosYaConfiguration>>();
        client.BaseAddress = new Uri(config.Value.BaseUrl);
        client.Timeout = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(config.Value.TimeoutSeconds);
    })
    .AddPolicyHandler(GetRetryPolicy())
    .AddPolicyHandler(GetCircuitBreakerPolicy());
```

